question(non-blocking): I believe we can use is_instance and rewrite it to avoid this exception handling right. Say something like:

```python
def _set_embeddings_response_properties(
    invocation: EmbeddingInvocation,
    result: Any,
) -> None:
    model = getattr(result, "model", None)
    if isinstance(model, str):
        invocation.response_model_name = model

    data = getattr(result, "data", None)
    if isinstance(data, (list, tuple)) and data:
        embedding = getattr(data[0], "embedding", None)
        if isinstance(embedding, (list, tuple)):
            _set_embedding_dimension_count(invocation, len(embedding))

    # Embeddings only have input tokens; output tokens are not applicable.
    prompt_tokens = getattr(getattr(result, "usage", None), "prompt_tokens", None)
    if isinstance(prompt_tokens, int):
        invocation.input_tokens = prompt_tokens
```

